# pop'n music 9, e-AMUSEMENT on (popn9-eamuse-on.his first, same --nvram): a whole credit with a new
# card. Coins, Start, the card in (Insert), the name (red x3, then the entry's timer), the PIN
# 1234 twice on the 10-key; the server numbers the card, the game writes it ("card save
# complete"); then NORMAL, a song played, a second one left to the timer, and at the credit's
# end userdata.write (the server keeps it in eamuse/). About 46,000 frames.
#   hiraku-popn9 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn9-card-new.his
game popn9
at 4500 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4540 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4700 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 5050 press "Card" 8
at 5500 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 5560 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 5620 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 9150 press "Keypad 1" 8
at 9180 press "Keypad 2" 8
at 9210 press "Keypad 3" 8
at 9240 press "Keypad 4" 8
at 9270 press "Keypad Enter" 8
at 9550 press "Keypad 1" 8
at 9580 press "Keypad 2" 8
at 9610 press "Keypad 3" 8
at 9640 press "Keypad 4" 8
at 9670 press "Keypad Enter" 8
at 10100 press "P1 Button 5" 8 # mode select: NORMAL
at 10150 snap
at 10500 snap
at 10700 press "P1 Button 5" 8 # song select: this song
at 10750 snap
at 10900 press "P1 Button 5" 8 # confirm
at 10950 snap
at 11200 snap
